/P 61 0 R
/E (This section profiles ten of the most widely evaluated low-code platforms in 2026. Each profile summarizes what the platform is best known for, its typical buyer, and its general pricing posture; a consolidated master comparison appears in Section 8. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
