/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 61 0 R
/E (3.1 OutSystems )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
88 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 61 0 R
/E (OutSystems is positioned as an enterprise-grade platform built for large, complex, and highly scalable applications, with strong DevOps and full application lifecycle tooling. It supports cloud, on-premises, or hybrid deployment and was ranked the top development software platform on G2's 2026 list by developer satisfaction. Pricing is customized rather than published, and industry commentary notes that custom-priced enterprise platforms can run five to ten times the cost of simpler tools for comparable capability. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
89 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 61 0 R
/E (This survey synthesizes publicly available market research, analyst commentary, and industry reporting current as of mid-2026. Figures cited from multiple sources sometimes vary because different research firms use different definitions of the low-code and no-code market, different geographic scopes, and different forecast horizons. Where estimates diverge, this report presents the range rather than a single definitive figure. Platform pricing is likewise presented as commonly reported starting figures; actual costs vary by region, contract negotiation, and add-ons. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
